WEBVTT

00:06.910 --> 00:08.570
I will be strong.

00:11.390 --> 00:13.580
I'll definitely kill that girl!

00:15.010 --> 00:15.780
And...

00:24.100 --> 00:26.080
...I will become the true Hero!

00:40.230 --> 00:46.940
BANISHED FROM THE HERO'S PARTY, I DECIDED TO
LIVE A QUIET LIFE IN THE COUNTRYSIDE SEASON 2

01:58.220 --> 01:59.620
#09 AIMING AT A FAIRY IN LOVE
AND A GREEDY CARDINAL

01:59.620 --> 02:02.420
The reason I asked you all
to gather here

02:02.420 --> 02:04.760
was because I wanted to
talk to you about Van.

02:05.940 --> 02:11.110
I just got information from Ms. Esther
that Van will be back here soon.

02:11.960 --> 02:14.680
He seems to have
gained enough confidence

02:14.680 --> 02:16.910
after hunting monsters
in the South Seas.

02:18.680 --> 02:20.540
So he's serious!

02:21.240 --> 02:26.070
I heard that Van sometimes says he is
going to kill Ms. Ruti and laughs happily.

02:26.380 --> 02:27.790
That's really disgusting.

02:28.120 --> 02:31.830
So, how are we going to beat
that Hero bastard?

02:31.830 --> 02:34.650
If we do that,
the problem will be bigger.

02:34.650 --> 02:37.540
It's better to get rid of him
from Zoltan without a fight.

02:37.930 --> 02:39.310
That's right.

02:40.090 --> 02:43.520
So, I'm going to take action
while I have the chance.

02:44.980 --> 02:47.180
You've captured their picture very well.

02:47.180 --> 02:48.280
Who drew these?

02:48.850 --> 02:49.850
It's me.

02:49.850 --> 02:51.780
Tisse is good at this kind of thing.

02:54.890 --> 02:58.910
So, could you please provide us
with the information?

02:59.360 --> 02:59.830
Yes.

03:00.470 --> 03:01.910
First of all, this is about Van.

03:02.730 --> 03:05.490
He is the eighth prince of
the Kingdom of Flamberg,

03:05.890 --> 03:09.470
and he was raised
in a monastery from childhood.

03:10.700 --> 03:12.630
Among royalty and nobility,

03:12.630 --> 03:16.330
there seems to be a belief that it is
shameful to raise a child by oneself.

03:17.200 --> 03:19.740
There's certainly a tendency toward that.

03:20.520 --> 03:23.670
But I want to raise my child by myself!

03:23.670 --> 03:24.380
Yeah.

03:24.840 --> 03:26.190
That's the same for me.

03:26.630 --> 03:27.980
I think it's good.

03:30.420 --> 03:31.690
Umm,

03:32.440 --> 03:36.810
so you could say that Van's faith
was nurtured in that monastery?

03:37.110 --> 03:41.380
Yeah, and then Van went to the Great
Holy Fortress of the Last Wall

03:41.380 --> 03:43.580
and claimed he was a Hero.

03:43.580 --> 03:44.200
Yes.

03:45.030 --> 03:47.980
After he was recognized by the church,

03:48.320 --> 03:52.580
he hunted monsters to raise
the level of his blessing.

03:54.210 --> 03:56.200
That's the problem.

03:56.200 --> 03:59.980
Van lost many friends
while hunting monsters.

04:00.650 --> 04:02.360
A Hero's blessing

04:02.360 --> 04:04.530
should not abandon his friends,
shouldn't it?

04:05.530 --> 04:08.330
Van probably thinks deep in his heart

04:08.650 --> 04:10.730
that developing the blessings of a Hero

04:11.010 --> 04:13.250
is more important than
the lives of his friends.

04:14.330 --> 04:15.060
That's why...

04:15.440 --> 04:17.620
...he can abandon his friends.

04:18.329 --> 04:20.110
It's really pissed me off!

04:20.459 --> 04:22.650
How can someone like that be a Hero?!

04:22.650 --> 04:24.520
Danan, calm down.

04:25.020 --> 04:27.990
This is the only information I have on Van.

04:29.090 --> 04:31.100
I don't understand it.

04:31.100 --> 04:33.040
What's Van thinking?

04:33.940 --> 04:35.550
Van's world is small.

04:36.330 --> 04:40.000
In his world,
there is only himself and God.

04:40.900 --> 04:42.300
No parents, no friends,

04:42.610 --> 04:44.030
no loved ones.

04:45.180 --> 04:48.270
That's why he doesn't
question his values.

04:48.270 --> 04:50.810
He doesn't get lost,
and he doesn't get discouraged.

04:55.850 --> 04:57.270
About Lub and Lavender...

04:57.820 --> 05:00.820
Ms. Miststorm told us
about Lavender.

05:01.800 --> 05:02.900
Lavender...

05:03.500 --> 05:07.830
I saw her once before I moved to Zoltan.

05:08.540 --> 05:10.830
She didn't look like that,

05:10.830 --> 05:12.830
but I'll never forget her magic.

05:13.200 --> 05:15.840
What do you mean,
she didn't look like that?

05:16.230 --> 05:21.130
What I saw was a huge black shadow
with a lightning bolt.

05:21.720 --> 05:22.900
It's frustrating,

05:22.900 --> 05:27.080
but I'm retired from active duty, so she's
not someone I can do anything about.

05:27.840 --> 05:31.180
I'm sorry,
but can I leave this to you guys?

05:34.080 --> 05:36.400
Considering the damage
to the surrounding area,

05:36.400 --> 05:39.400
I would prefer not to fight
Lavender directly.

05:40.020 --> 05:43.250
I can't think of
a good opportunity to negotiate.

05:47.850 --> 05:50.040
Let me convince Lavender!

05:50.040 --> 05:50.870
What?

05:51.290 --> 05:53.440
We're dealing with an unknown monster.

05:53.440 --> 05:54.880
Are you sure you can handle it?

05:54.880 --> 05:57.360
I think I'm the right person to do it!

05:57.650 --> 06:00.130
Because I'm in love right now!

06:00.390 --> 06:01.110
Huh?

06:03.920 --> 06:05.540
Eh? What?

06:06.340 --> 06:10.500
Umm, Lavender's nature is very
different from humans,

06:10.500 --> 06:13.800
but I think we are the same
in that we are in love!

06:13.800 --> 06:16.340
So I'm going to use that
as a negotiation topic...

06:16.340 --> 06:17.150
Is that all?

06:17.440 --> 06:18.930
That's all!

06:18.930 --> 06:21.650
But who else has a chance to do it?

06:25.110 --> 06:26.230
I agree.

06:27.170 --> 06:29.660
Danan, will you go with Rit?

06:29.910 --> 06:33.160
Me? I think it's better
if you go with her instead.

06:33.940 --> 06:36.020
I'll handle the negotiations with Lub.

06:36.950 --> 06:39.630
Sounds fun! I'm coming with you.

06:40.110 --> 06:43.580
If that's the case,
leave Rit's escort to me!

06:44.220 --> 06:46.140
I beg you, Danan.

06:46.830 --> 06:49.300
Cardinal Lub was born a commoner

06:49.740 --> 06:53.500
and rose through the ranks with only
the cardinal's blessing to rely on.

06:55.320 --> 06:56.920
He has been lining his pockets

06:56.920 --> 06:59.820
with bribes, embezzlement,
and all manner of other means.

07:00.830 --> 07:03.720
But he already knows
your face, right, Mr. Red?

07:04.230 --> 07:05.470
I'll be in disguise.

07:06.160 --> 07:09.380
Ruti will continue to make
her presence known.

07:09.900 --> 07:11.690
Tisse, you'll follow up with Ruti.

07:12.120 --> 07:12.690
Yes.

07:15.760 --> 07:18.580
Everything we do is to
protect Zoltan and Ruti.

07:19.080 --> 07:20.180
Let's do our best.

07:20.180 --> 07:21.470
Yeah!

07:21.470 --> 07:22.340
You can count on us.

07:22.780 --> 07:24.700
Thank you, everyone.

07:26.630 --> 07:28.840
So, the meeting's over.

07:29.590 --> 07:30.600
Let's eat.

07:30.600 --> 07:32.370
That's what I've been waiting for!

07:53.940 --> 07:55.450
Tisse, what's wrong?

07:55.880 --> 07:56.640
Mr. Red.

07:57.530 --> 07:59.330
No, um...

08:00.150 --> 08:02.490
I was wondering if there's
anything I could do

08:02.490 --> 08:04.740
until Van gets back to Zoltan.

08:05.410 --> 08:07.100
You're worried about taking it easy?

08:07.680 --> 08:08.310
Yes.

08:09.200 --> 08:11.850
I found the Hero Van
to be more frightening

08:11.850 --> 08:13.580
than strong.

08:14.420 --> 08:16.100
The blessing in me

08:16.360 --> 08:19.600
tells me that killing him will be difficult.

08:20.070 --> 08:23.100
If that's how you feel,
then you must be right.

08:23.710 --> 08:25.700
How did you feel, Mr. Red?

08:26.710 --> 08:28.170
They are the Heroes,

08:28.660 --> 08:32.120
but why are Van and Ms. Ruti so different?

08:32.960 --> 08:33.720
You're right.

08:34.590 --> 08:35.289
First of all,

08:35.740 --> 08:39.120
the way those two fight
as Heroes is very different.

08:39.900 --> 08:41.159
The way they fight?

08:42.510 --> 08:45.450
Ruti is a "hero who never loses"
who aims to be strong enough

08:45.760 --> 08:49.080
not to be defeated,
no matter who the enemy is.

08:49.850 --> 08:51.290
And what about Hero Van?

08:51.960 --> 08:53.790
I think he aims to win

08:53.790 --> 08:56.870
with his strongest attack
without expecting the enemy.

08:57.510 --> 08:59.600
In other words,
he is an "invincible hero."

09:00.070 --> 09:03.460
The Hero who never loses,
and the Hero who is invincible...

09:04.320 --> 09:07.230
Ruti has all kinds of enemies in mind,

09:07.700 --> 09:09.770
whereas Van has no enemies in mind.

09:10.490 --> 09:13.750
Well, I wouldn't choose
Van's way of fighting.

09:14.030 --> 09:15.640
Me too.

09:16.330 --> 09:18.750
My sword has a winning formula,

09:19.530 --> 09:21.020
but if I rely on it alone,

09:21.370 --> 09:23.150
I will surely be defeated one day.

09:23.980 --> 09:25.980
That is his weakness.

09:27.140 --> 09:27.940
In other words,

09:28.360 --> 09:32.140
it's Van who relies on his blessing
and Ruti who doesn't.

09:32.700 --> 09:33.880
I see.

09:34.490 --> 09:36.810
I now understand the difference
between those two.

09:37.610 --> 09:41.270
Ms. Ruti's strength
is because of Mr. Red's guidance.

09:41.850 --> 09:46.620
Well, I wanted to make sure
that Ruti could protect herself.

09:47.290 --> 09:51.260
I am so glad that Mr. Red
was guiding Ms. Ruti.

09:51.940 --> 09:52.550
But...

09:52.950 --> 09:55.780
I guess Van didn't have anyone
like that around him.

09:57.450 --> 09:58.230
I see.

09:58.980 --> 10:00.780
Van's world is small.

10:03.810 --> 10:06.100
I feel relieved now.

10:06.510 --> 10:07.430
Good to hear that.

10:12.800 --> 10:13.670
Mr. Lub,

10:13.670 --> 10:16.260
no matter how much he has
raised his level of blessing,

10:16.700 --> 10:19.400
there is no guarantee
that he can beat that girl.

10:19.670 --> 10:24.270
What is the point of risking the lives
of heroes in such a remote country?

10:24.270 --> 10:27.220
Either way, the first step
is to gather information.

10:27.220 --> 10:29.770
Find out the identity of
the girl who defeated Van

10:29.770 --> 10:31.190
and report back to me.

10:45.100 --> 10:47.960
Good grief, it's a total hassle.

10:48.230 --> 10:50.800
What are they going to do this time?!

10:50.800 --> 10:52.210
As I said before,

10:52.770 --> 10:55.400
let's leave it to Red and the others
to deal with that Hero.

10:55.850 --> 11:00.860
All we can do is try not to upset or cause
commotion among the townspeople.

11:01.230 --> 11:03.650
Yes, let's do that!

11:21.800 --> 11:22.860
Let me introduce you.

11:23.490 --> 11:25.400
He is my squire, Albert.

11:26.810 --> 11:28.500
It was nice to meet you all, everyone.

11:28.500 --> 11:30.250
I'll look forward to working with you.

11:30.590 --> 11:31.950
I've heard a lot about you.

11:32.320 --> 11:35.260
You work hard for the Heroes, right?

11:35.700 --> 11:36.740
It's my honor.

11:37.500 --> 11:40.760
How was your trip on the airship, Hero Van?

11:41.110 --> 11:42.040
It was good.

11:42.520 --> 11:45.780
The island in the South Seas was full
of monsters that killed people,

11:45.780 --> 11:48.230
so it was a great way to raise
the level of my blessing.

11:48.230 --> 11:50.270
Yes, I'm sure I can beat her next time!

11:59.130 --> 12:00.950
I need to go find that girl.

12:01.280 --> 12:01.990
No,

12:02.520 --> 12:05.220
we'll gather information on the girl.

12:05.680 --> 12:08.730
You don't have object
tracking skills, don't you?

12:09.400 --> 12:12.440
Van, you need to get some rest.

12:12.820 --> 12:15.260
Let us handle this.

12:28.460 --> 12:30.460
Van! Don't worry!

12:30.460 --> 12:32.610
I am always with you.

12:42.030 --> 12:42.780
Oh?

12:43.290 --> 12:44.630
It seems we have some bugs.

12:49.840 --> 12:52.040
You bugs sneaking around there!

12:53.340 --> 12:55.450
Oh, you caught us.

12:56.490 --> 12:58.220
Shall I crush you up good?

12:58.600 --> 13:02.970
Yeah, now that Van's gone,
you can really go for it, can't you?

13:03.610 --> 13:04.860
What?!

13:04.860 --> 13:08.730
I know that a fearsome blessing
resides in your little body.

13:09.320 --> 13:12.620
Your nature is a giant,
and you have a wild force.

13:14.790 --> 13:17.470
Why do you, a living being
who looks down on humans,

13:17.470 --> 13:21.740
hide your true nature
and pretend to be a little fairy?

13:24.140 --> 13:26.710
Is it because you are in love with Van?

13:27.240 --> 13:31.760
You know that your appearance
is frightening to humans.

13:32.240 --> 13:33.870
In order to be loved by Van,

13:33.870 --> 13:37.220
you took the form of a fairy,
as humans imagine.

13:37.220 --> 13:39.830
If you talk any more,
I will kill you!

13:43.500 --> 13:45.450
I am in love too!

13:45.450 --> 13:48.020
So, I want to talk about love with you!

13:56.440 --> 13:59.020
My name is Rizlet of Loggervia.

13:59.550 --> 14:00.780
You can call me Rit.

14:01.900 --> 14:02.950
Rit, huh?

14:03.370 --> 14:05.980
And is he your partner?

14:09.440 --> 14:11.140
No, it's not him.

14:11.140 --> 14:15.290
I thought so!
He doesn't look like he's in love!

14:15.830 --> 14:18.730
I should not tell such
make-up stories to Lavender.

14:19.330 --> 14:22.800
I have to expose her myself
and find her common interests.

14:23.160 --> 14:27.050
I was a princess of the Duchy
of Loggervia, north of here.

14:28.880 --> 14:31.380
Oh, so you were a princess, huh?

14:31.660 --> 14:33.780
Then, was your partner
a prince or a knight?

14:33.780 --> 14:35.220
Or maybe—
Oopsie!

14:35.910 --> 14:37.590
He is a knight of another kingdom.

14:37.850 --> 14:41.070
We are now living together
as commoners in Zoltan.

14:41.350 --> 14:44.780
So you're eloping?!
You really are something!

14:44.780 --> 14:49.130
You're willing to sacrifice
everything for love, aren't you?

14:49.130 --> 14:52.080
Yes, I truly believe that.

14:52.790 --> 14:55.610
I want to be with him
forever and ever,

14:56.120 --> 14:59.280
until the very last moment of our lives.

14:59.280 --> 15:00.630
Yes, you passed!

15:00.630 --> 15:02.330
I order mead and salad, please!

15:09.260 --> 15:10.720
And so...

15:11.030 --> 15:13.740
There was a period of time
when he and I were apart,

15:14.250 --> 15:16.830
but it helped us grow

15:16.830 --> 15:18.440
and love each other more.

15:19.950 --> 15:21.090
What?

15:22.650 --> 15:26.740
You mean you don't love him
when in Loggervia?

15:27.110 --> 15:28.740
That's not true!

15:28.740 --> 15:30.900
I loved the old Red, too!

15:30.900 --> 15:32.560
What are you talking about?

15:32.560 --> 15:34.910
Growing up is not love!

15:34.910 --> 15:38.040
Love is a beautiful, happy,
and perfect thing.

15:38.040 --> 15:40.460
From the moment you fall in love,
time stands still,

15:40.740 --> 15:44.510
and you wish it would never change.

15:44.960 --> 15:47.760
It's not love if you don't feel that way.

15:48.890 --> 15:51.760
You don't want Van to change, do you?

15:51.760 --> 15:54.770
Of course not! Mead again!

15:55.670 --> 15:58.120
Lavender doesn't want Van to change.

15:59.160 --> 16:03.060
That means she is just
pushing her own love.

16:06.070 --> 16:09.440
I would destroy the world for this feeling.

16:09.440 --> 16:11.670
That is true love.

16:12.310 --> 16:15.410
But what if you were
the one being destroyed?

16:17.800 --> 16:21.660
The Demon King's army
has some very strong enemies.

16:21.990 --> 16:24.860
Just because he's a Hero
doesn't mean he'll always win.

16:25.620 --> 16:27.950
If you're in love with him,
you should be worried.

16:29.100 --> 16:32.870
I'm going to put Van
before anything else.

16:33.380 --> 16:35.610
And if he dies,

16:36.820 --> 16:38.590
I'll die with him!

16:40.080 --> 16:43.370
I'll be in love with Van
until the moment of my death.

16:43.370 --> 16:46.560
I couldn't have asked for
a happier story than this.

16:46.880 --> 16:48.820
So you think like that.

16:49.670 --> 16:51.390
Yeah, unlike you.

16:55.660 --> 16:57.830
Lavender, I would ask you a favor.

16:57.830 --> 16:59.370
A favor?

16:59.370 --> 17:03.600
No, no, I won't do anything
except what Van says.

17:03.600 --> 17:06.089
But this is for Van's sake, too.

17:07.579 --> 17:08.960
Well, say it.

17:09.450 --> 17:12.339
I want you to tell Van
to stay away from Zoltan.

17:15.910 --> 17:19.740
The fight here is not
worth risking his life for.

17:20.119 --> 17:22.900
The only thing he'll get out
of it is raising his blessing.

17:22.900 --> 17:26.200
And I think the Hero
has other battles to fight.

17:26.890 --> 17:28.820
Well, you're right.

17:29.440 --> 17:30.090
Then...

17:30.090 --> 17:31.570
Of course, I refuse.

17:32.450 --> 17:33.800
I knew you would say that!

17:34.870 --> 17:36.620
Oh, thank goodness.

17:36.620 --> 17:39.980
I'd have killed you if you'd
insisted for one second.

17:39.980 --> 17:41.330
That would be trouble!

17:42.140 --> 17:43.700
Well, before we part...

17:47.380 --> 17:50.630
Let's hope we can chat again
in peace like this.

17:50.630 --> 17:54.180
This is so weird.
It's not a promise or a prayer.

17:54.180 --> 17:55.200
Cheers!

18:05.440 --> 18:08.140
Go! Go for it!

18:08.140 --> 18:09.750
Come on, run!

18:09.750 --> 18:12.300
Faster! Faster!

18:12.300 --> 18:14.130
Chase them! Come on!

18:14.130 --> 18:16.980
W-What?! Why did you stop there?!

18:16.980 --> 18:19.240
Run! Run!

18:19.240 --> 18:20.700
This thing...

18:20.700 --> 18:22.790
Goddamit! This is ridiculous!

18:22.790 --> 18:24.500
Give me back my money!

18:24.500 --> 18:27.410
Hey, is there a rematch for this?!

18:27.410 --> 18:28.600
Mr. Lub.

18:28.600 --> 18:30.090
It's my day off!

18:30.420 --> 18:32.410
We can talk on another day!

18:32.410 --> 18:34.750
I have some information
I would like to tell you.

18:35.520 --> 18:37.100
It will not disadvantage you.

18:42.900 --> 18:44.490
Number 5 is overweight.

18:44.490 --> 18:46.660
This is Zoltan.

18:46.660 --> 18:48.610
Nothing is certain.

18:48.950 --> 18:50.820
How much will you bet?

18:56.840 --> 18:58.860
Red, will you be okay?

18:59.220 --> 19:02.000
You can't even negotiate with him
if your bet is missed.

19:02.000 --> 19:03.910
Of course, I have a plan.

19:11.040 --> 19:11.740
I see.

19:18.800 --> 19:21.390
Well, it was really splendid.

19:21.910 --> 19:26.040
I never thought he would win
that race from behind.

19:26.040 --> 19:28.070
Now that you've made so much money...

19:28.070 --> 19:31.400
Mr. Lub, I know a good
wine store around here.

19:31.780 --> 19:33.230
Just to let you know,

19:33.230 --> 19:35.950
I am very picky about wine.

19:47.830 --> 19:48.880
Oh?

19:49.400 --> 19:54.190
It is fresh and pleasant, and the texture
is like fine silk on the tongue.

19:55.000 --> 19:59.220
Gradually, the firm fruitiness
and richness unfold.

20:04.640 --> 20:06.460
Woah!

20:06.460 --> 20:08.230
I get it now.

20:08.230 --> 20:11.260
It has a wildness, as if an elegant lady
suddenly took off her clothes

20:11.260 --> 20:15.080
and ran wildly in the forest.

20:16.250 --> 20:19.540
I didn't know that Zoltan could
make such a good wine.

20:19.800 --> 20:21.740
Please try this fish dish.

20:24.250 --> 20:27.170
W-What is this fish dish?

20:27.170 --> 20:29.690
It is a fish paste smothered with herbs

20:29.690 --> 20:32.290
and roasted in the finest olive oil.

20:32.290 --> 20:34.300
She's talking about randomly again...

20:35.270 --> 20:37.520
You're cooking a fish dish like that?

20:37.820 --> 20:40.550
What is this restaurant thinking?

20:48.340 --> 20:51.470
T-T-This...!

20:53.670 --> 20:55.590
It's a taste that defies common sense!

20:56.230 --> 20:57.570
This has a deep flavor!

21:00.880 --> 21:03.180
Mr. Lub, may I have a word with you?

21:03.460 --> 21:07.030
You boorish scoundrel!
I knew you'd say something like that.

21:07.370 --> 21:08.580
What do you want?

21:08.850 --> 21:10.670
Are you here to talk about business?

21:10.670 --> 21:12.580
It's about Mr. Van.

21:13.030 --> 21:15.410
Don't mind if he's a bit annoying.

21:15.410 --> 21:18.170
He's a Hero who will save the world.

21:18.170 --> 21:22.090
It's about the dangers of the girl
that Mr. Van is looking for.

21:23.870 --> 21:26.060
You know the girl who attacked Van?!

21:26.320 --> 21:26.810
Yes, I do.

21:27.170 --> 21:29.280
Who is she?!

21:29.730 --> 21:31.660
Ancient elf's heritage.

21:31.660 --> 21:32.350
What?

21:36.840 --> 21:38.410
What a nonsense.

21:38.410 --> 21:42.390
The legacy of the ancient elves is
a bunch of mechanical clockwork.

21:42.710 --> 21:45.120
I knew you wouldn't
believe me with just words,

21:45.710 --> 21:46.900
so please come with me.

21:57.610 --> 21:59.240
Ogre king, huh?

22:05.040 --> 22:06.840
This is an ancient elf's writing!

22:07.300 --> 22:08.420
What does that mean?!

22:08.860 --> 22:11.300
This ogre king was different
from the normal one.

22:11.300 --> 22:13.890
They were intelligent
and could use weapons.

22:14.370 --> 22:18.050
It is believed to be a biological weapon
built into the ruins of the ancient elf.

22:18.050 --> 22:19.060
What?

22:19.610 --> 22:21.540
Because there are ancient elf heritage sites

22:21.540 --> 22:23.820
in the mountains north of Zoltan.

22:24.440 --> 22:26.860
There are other biological weapons there,

22:26.860 --> 22:30.330
some of which seem to exist in human form.

22:30.950 --> 22:34.300
The girl who attacked Van
is of ancient elf heritage.

22:34.720 --> 22:40.340
It is true that a girl is powerful
enough to overthrow Van.

22:40.850 --> 22:44.860
And a report from the Thieves' Guild
of Zoltan corroborates this.

22:45.370 --> 22:46.330
I see.

22:46.900 --> 22:50.600
So she was created as a guardian
of ancient elf ruins?

22:52.680 --> 22:56.060
If the Demon King's army
ever arrives in Zoltan,

22:56.660 --> 22:59.820
this ancient elven heritage will fight back.

23:00.320 --> 23:05.030
So you want Van to withdraw
from this battle for the sake of humanity?

23:05.030 --> 23:05.840
Yes.

23:06.340 --> 23:12.330
It would be a loss for mankind if either
Van or the ancient elf heritage died.

23:12.750 --> 23:13.990
Indeed.

23:13.990 --> 23:17.980
I will advise Van to leave Zoltan as it is.

23:17.980 --> 23:18.790
Please do.

23:19.230 --> 23:20.630
Even though I will tell him,

23:20.970 --> 23:26.910
lately Van has stopped
obeying my words.
